    <statement><p>Consider the parametric curve <m>f(t) = \left\lt \left(t-5\right)^{5},t\mathopen{}\left(1+2t\right)\right&gt;</m>.</p>
<p>The velocity vector is <m>\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;v\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt;(t)</m> = <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>and the acceleration vector is <m>\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;a\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt;(t)</m> = <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0002"/>.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;5\mathopen{}\left(t-5\right)^{4},1+2t+2t\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;20\mathopen{}\left(t-5\right)^{3},4\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
